{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "06", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "03", "M": "39", "S": "42"}}, "news": [{"title": "Telengana readies sweeping land pooling policy for infrastructure projects", "para": "The Telangana government plans to roll out a novel land pooling policy designed for infrastructure advancements throughout the state. Instead of receiving monetary compensation, landowners will be rewarded with developed plots when their land is acquired. Initiatives for projects like the Musi riverfront are already in progress, aiming to lower land acquisition expenses.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/telengana-readies-sweeping-land-pooling-policy-for-infrastructure-projects/134721965?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-268614/134721965.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Notice to 500 homeowners in HSVP sectors in Gurugram for building code violations", "para": "Haryana Shehri Vikas Pradhikaran has launched a crackdown on homeowners misusing residential spaces for business purposes. Approximately 500 property owners have been notified for various breaches. With an increased focus on compliance, estate offices are conducting detailed surveys. Homeowners will have the chance to respond, yet failure to correct these violations may lead to disconnections of services or reclaiming of properties by the authorities.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/notice-to-500-homeowners-in-hsvp-sectors-in-gurugram-for-building-code-violations/134721910?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-224070/134721910.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "FIR against Ghaziabad's RKS Buildcon India for handing over flats without CC", "para": "RKS Buildcon India stands